{"resourceIdentifier":"4141","resourceName":"Itamarati Grouped REDD Project","description":"The Itamarati Grouped REDD Project is initially formed by 4 properties  located in the municipalities of Nova Olímpia, Denise, Barra dos Bugres, Salto do Céu and Reserva do Cabaçal in the State of Mato Grosso, Brazil. Instance 1 is located in the Amazon and Cerrado biomes. The total area of the properties is 69,207.15 ha. The project aims to avoid the unplanned deforestation (AUD) within the 22,753.36 ha project area, consisting of 64% Amazon rainforest and 36% Cerrado. The present REDD project is expected to avoid predicted 4,861 ha of deforestation, equating to 1,264,521 tCO2e in emissions reductions over the 30-year project lifetime, with an annual average of 42,151 tCO2e.\r\n\r\nIn addition to the project’s ecological and carbon benefits, a proportion of the carbon credits generated will be dedicated to improving the social and environmental conditions in the project region, specifically contributing to improving deforestation control, aiming at the propagation of environmental awareness, generation of alternative sources of income and environmental education actions.","location":{"latitude":-14.841580,"longitude":-57.867663},"inPublicCommentPeriod":false,"lastPublicCommentPeriod":{"startInclusive":"2023-03-01","endExclusive":"2023-04-01","endInclusive":"2023-03-31"},"attributes":[{"code":"PROJECT_ID","values":[{"type":"string","value":"4141"}]},{"code":"STATE_PROVINCE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Mato Grosso"}]}],"participationSummaries":[{"programCode":"VCS","attributes":[{"code":"PROPONENT_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Future Carbon Holding S.A."},{"type":"string","value":"São Paulo, Brazil"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_STATUS","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Withdrawn"}]},{"code":"EST_ANNUAL_EMISSION_REDCT","values":[{"type":"string","value":"42151"}]},{"code":"PRIMARY_PROJECT_CATEGORY_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Agriculture Forestry and Other Land Use"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_SUBCATERGORY_NAMES","values":[{"type":"string","value":"REDD"}]},{"code":"PROTOCOL_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"VM0015"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_ACREAGE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"22753 Hectares"}]},{"code":"VALIDATOR_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"VCS Validation/Verification Body"}]},{"code":"CREDIT_PERIOD_INFO","values":[{"type":"string","value":"1st, 25/04/2022 - 24/04/2052"}]}]}],"documentGroups":[{"code":"VCS_PIPELINE_DOCUMENTS","description":"VCS Pipeline Documents","documents":[{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=84668&IDKEY=38723kjnf7kjandsaslmdv09887vaksmrmnwqkjoiuanfnfuq0n116757172","documentType":"Draft Project Description","documentName":"VCS-Project-Description_Itamarati Grouped REDD Project_v01.pdf","uploadDate":"2023-02-14T14:42:25.007Z"},{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=83668&IDKEY=kq934lkmsad39asjdkfj90qlkalsdkngaf98ulkandDfdvDdfha115378172","documentType":"Listing Representation","documentName":"Itamarati Grouped REDD Project - Listing 27.01.pdf","uploadDate":"2023-01-27T21:23:35.347Z"}]},{"code":"VCS_REGISTRATION_DOCUMENTS","description":"VCS Registration Documents","documents":[]},{"code":"VCS_ISSUANCE_DOCUMENTS","description":"VCS Issuance Documents","documents":[]},{"code":"VCS_OTHER_DOCUMENTS","description":"VCS Other Documents","documents":[{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=83669&IDKEY=98723kjnf7kjandsaslmdv09887vaksmrmnwqkjoiuanfnfuq07115379551","documentType":"KML File","documentName":"project_area_itamarati.kml","uploadDate":"2023-01-27T21:24:18.55Z"},{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=94493&IDKEY=a097809fdslkjf09rndasfufd098asodfjlkduf09nm23mrn87f130305847","documentType":"Public Commentary","documentName":"Public_Comments_Summary_ID_4141_.pdf","uploadDate":"2023-07-26T11:01:36.033Z"}]